<body>
<div type="letter">


<pb facs="1039256" n="307r"/>
  <opener><lb/><salute><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaus Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>J. U. D.</abbr> et in <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-36146-X"><abbr>Univ.</abbr> Basiliensi</rs> <abbr>Phil.</abbr> <abbr>Prof.</abbr>
      <lb/>Illustrissimo ac Celeberrimo Viro
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117592307">Francisco Mari<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Zanotto</rs>
      <lb type="deleted"/><del><gap/></del>
      <lb type="deleted"/><del><gap/></del>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></salute></opener>
  <p>
      <lb/>Intellexi quidem, <del><gap/></del><add>V</add>ir Illustrissime, jam antehac de lauda<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tissimo Vestro <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-115557-X">Scientiarum et Artium Instituto</rs>: verum
      <lb/>accuratior de eodem notitia mihi haud suppetit, quam qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>hauriri potest ex <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_SHKN7BFP">Actis <add>Eruditorum</add> <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-2879139">Lipsi<del><gap/></del><add><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></add></rs> <seg type="transposition">mense <date when="1724-01">Januario hujus anni</date></seg>
      <lb/>publicatis</rs>. <del><gap/></del>Ex illis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ibi <del><gap/></del>memori<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> prodita
      <lb/>sunt facile colligere po<del><gap/></del><add>ssum</add>, istam <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-115557-X">Academiam</rs> esse et optime
      <lb/>constitutam et florentissimam: neque dubito id Vobis cur<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>esse, ut eam porro <del><gap/></del><add>conserveris</add> florentissimam. Illud autem vehemen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ter dubito, an scopum istum fueritis asse<del><gap/></del>cuti, dum me, cujus
      <lb/>valde exigua aut nulla in rem literariam sunt merita, in
      <lb/><rs type="person">Academicorum Honorariorum</rs> numerum <add>vestrum omnium consensione</add> excepistis. Tribuo sane
      <lb/>honorificum <add>hoc</add> <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-115557-X">Academi<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> Vestr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> de me judicium <del><gap/></del><add>V</add>estro potius,
      <lb/>ipsius inprimis Excellentissimi Fundatoris Comitis <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118640968">Marsigli</rs>,
      <lb/>favori et co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>endationi, quam ullis meis meritis. Quapropter
      <lb/>ut mihi desint vires gloriam et co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>oda <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-115557-X">Academi<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> vestr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>promovendi, non tamen deest animus gratus, quem tanti bene<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ficii et favoris memorem <del><gap/></del><add>nunquam non conservabo.</add></p>
  <closer>
      <lb/><salute>Vale.</salute> <dateline><rs type="place" key="place_GEO-2661604">Basile<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1724-11-14">14. <abbr>Nov.</abbr> 1724.</date></dateline>
  </closer>
    <lb/><note hand="unknown">Zanotto</note>
